# Rough the chamber down to a pressure, then seal it
# Closes the vent, fill and gate valves, starts the vacuum pump and waits 15 s as
# the controller requires, opens the vacuum valve, waits for the pressure, then
# closes the vacuum valve and stops the pump. It leaves the turbo pump and the
# foreline valve as they are: the turbo's spin-down cannot be read, so a block
# cannot know when the foreline may close. If the turbo is running, opening the
# vacuum valve is refused and the run stops there.
block pumpdown to <pressure:number 0.01..760 Torr>
load rLACO

hvc vent close
hvc fill close
hvc gate close
hvc pump on
hold 15 s
hvc rough open
until chamberP below {pressure} timeout 20 min
hvc stop
